<package name="COMMODORE_64_EXPANSION_PORT_CARD_EDGE">
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Commodore 64 44-Contact (22 top + 22 bottom) Expansion Port Card-Edge.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contacts are 0.05" x 0.35" on a 0.1" pitch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contacts are numbered 1 to 22 on top and A to Z on bottom (excludes G, I, O, and Q). Contacts 1 and A are on same end of card-edge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Card edge protrudes 0.55" from main circuit board.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
